cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or refer to this analysis, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bayesian-qubit-characterization"
abstract: >
  Bayesian/Fisher-information-matrix based statistical analysis of
  superconducting-qubit experimental data, applied from a
  gravitational-wave physics background. Covers resonator
  quality-factor estimation (Fano lineshape fitting), avoided-crossing
  spectroscopy, and two-level-system (TLS) noise diagnostics, with
  synthetic-data validation at each step.
authors:
